22:59:25.001 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
22:59:25.002   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
22:59:25.002   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
22:59:25.002   the client freezes on 'Connecting...'.
